WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.014 --> 00:00:06.398
Ricky: We should make Dad some chicken-noodle soup.

2
00:00:06.399 --> 00:00:08.833
Rachel: Good idea, Ricky.

3
00:00:08.834 --> 00:00:14.650
I can’t find any chicken soup. Ricky:

4
00:00:14.651 --> 00:00:23.055
That’s okay. We can use tomato soup. Hmm,

5
00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:28.161
maybe we can add something. Rachel:

6
00:00:28.162 --> 00:00:37.759
I don’t see any chicken, Ricky. Ricky:

7
00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:43.123
We can use hot dogs. Rachel:

8
00:00:43.124 --> 00:00:46.467
What else can we put in the soup? Ricky:

9
00:00:46.468 --> 00:00:50.688
I don’t like vegetables in my soup. Rachel:

10
00:00:50.689 --> 00:01:04.363
Me neither. Let’s put in some fruits. Ricky:

11
00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:15.968
Now we’ll just heat up the soup for five minutes. Rachel:

12
00:01:15.969 --> 00:01:23.134
What’s that noise, Ricky? Ricky

13
00:01:23.135 --> 00:01:28.350
& Rachel: Oh no! Yuck!

14
00:01:28.351 --> 00:01:33.480
Ricky: I’ll clean this mess up.

15
00:01:33.481 --> 00:01:42.678
Ricky & Rachel: We made you some soup, Dad.

16
00:01:42.679 --> 00:01:50.394
Dad: This is the best soup I’ve ever had.

